      "caption": "80s Love Songs Playlist ☕ | Soft Rock Ballads & Classic Love Songs Mix | Vol.61",
      "note": "I know this is AI. And yet I haven't enjoyed music like this in a long time. Growing up, songs were how I kept track of time. When a song from back then plays, I'm right there again, in every decade I grew up in. Somewhere in the last ten years or so, that stopped. Maybe it's life, or streaming, or the newer stuff never felt like mine. I can't put my finger on it, but these AI songs keep reminding me of something I've lost.",
